<title>USA: Monsanto sees R&amp;D write-off from deals.</title>
<headline>Monsanto sees R&amp;D write-off from deals.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monsanto Co on Friday said it could write off as much as &quot;a couple hundred million&quot; dollars this year for in-process research related to its planned Asgrow Agronomics and Holden's Foundation Seed Co acquisitions.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be some in-process R&amp;D write-off upfront,&quot; Monsanto Chief Economist Nicholas Filippello said. &quot;For Holden's and Asgrow together, it could approach a couple hundred million upfront.&quot;</p>
</text>
